(…)?          capture group #1, 0 or 1 (greedy)
└─ a          "a" literally
# optional a  comment (ignored)
(?(1)…)       conditional: pick a branch depending on the condition
├─ (1)        if group #1 matched
├─ b          then: "b" literally
└─ c          otherwise: "c" literally
\1            same text as group #1
(?:…)*        non-capturing group, 0 or more (greedy)
└─ x|yz       one of 2 alternatives
   ├─ x       "x" literally
   └─ yz      "yz" literally
[^\n\t]       any char except: newline, tab
